; What loading console costs: a program that links console pays, as it starts,
; for every value a console module builds as it loads, whether it draws
; anything or not. Every module of every library is linked, so each
; initialiser runs, and init_first comes first, so it samples them all.

(test
 (name test)
 (package console-eio)
 (deps
  (glob_files_rec %{project_root}/lib/**.ml))
 (link_flags (-linkall))
 (libraries
  init_first
  console
  console.text
  console_width
  console.input
  console.tty
  console-eio
  alcotest
  fmt))
